Files copied from src/lib/ with their license headers kept:
  audio-recorder.ts, audioworklet-registry.ts, utils.ts, worklets/audio-processing.ts, worklets/vol-meter.ts

Modification (Apache-2.0 §4b):
  audio-recorder.ts: the eventemitter3 import now points to ./eventEmitter.ts (our own minimal
  on/off/emit), because eventemitter3 is not a dependency of this app; and the unused Promise
  executor parameter `reject` is renamed `_reject` so the app's strict tsc (noUnusedParameters)
  passes.
  utils.ts: removed silent-clip autoplay probe; context created directly on user gesture.
  audioContext() used to play a silent data-URI clip to test the autoplay policy (and wait for a
  pointer/key event if it failed) before creating the AudioContext. Donor Desk always starts
  recording from a click, so the probe only added delay (~40 ms measured) before recording began.
  audio-recorder.ts, utils.ts: an /* eslint-disable */ comment under the license header, so the
  app's lint rules (no-var, no-async-promise-executor) don't require rewriting Google's code.
No other changes.

eventEmitter.ts is ours and not part of the lift.
